'''Junior God Suruzu ''' (神徒スルズ, Shinto Suruzu) is an enemy appearing in the [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]. She was added in [[Version 4.4 Update|Version 4.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Junior God Suruzu
|appearance = [[Yurudrasil Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 202.png
|money drop = 990円 - 3,910円
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy has somewhat low health and attack power, along with 300 range and is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy.

==Strategy==
Since this enemy is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy, using units such as [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]], [[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]] and anything that is above 300 range will deal with this enemy in no time.

